    "body": "Stopped before implementation. This worker runs on macOS. The installed Rust targets are aarch64-apple-darwin and x86_64-apple-darwin. Wine is not installed. I inspected main.rs, win_console.rs, and app logging.rs; the Windows entry point still installs the stderr subscriber without a file fallback. I could not run the unchanged Windows GUI executable to establish the failing reproduction required by Step 5. No pinning test ran, and no source files changed. Releasing this claim so a Windows worker can reproduce the console-free launch first.\n",
